<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Zurich Assurance.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Zurich Assurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Product</p>
<p>(Guernsey) Ltd has issued a total of one million American-style</p>
<p>call warrants, on Zurich Assurance, lead manager</p>
<p>Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>Two warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    350.00 SFR		PREMIUM	15.32 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     17.00 SFR		 GEARING	9.8 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.OCT.96-20.FEB.98   PAYDATE	02.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
